{"id":"n16346-1-7","stage":2,"title":"날리다 · 使飞扬","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16346-1-7-1","ko":"너도 모형 비행기를 샀어?","zh":"你也买了模型飞机吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모형","meaning":"模型","explanation":"모형：模型","readings":[{"term":"모형","audio":"/audio/00e9b33fa6e7c3c4c2b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56053","senseId":"1","lemma":"모형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비행기를","meaning":"飞机","explanation":"비행기：飞机；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"비행기","audio":"/audio/3cb2c44c3b680b229e91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15679","senseId":"1","lemma":"비행기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샀어?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"00e9b33fa6e7c3c4","term":"모형","zh":"模型","audio":"/audio/00e9b33fa6e7c3c4c2b7.mp3","entryId":"56053","definition":"仿照实物的形状制成的物体。","pronunciation":["모형"]},{"id":"3cb2c44c3b680b22","term":"비행기","zh":"飞机","audio":"/audio/3cb2c44c3b680b229e91.mp3","entryId":"15679","definition":"载着人或东西在空中飞行的交通工具。","pronunciation":["비행기"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/22cb06ba1f02b2a51127.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16346-1-7-2","ko":"응. 내일 학교 운동장에 날리러 가자.","zh":"嗯。明天一起去学校操场放飞吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"운동장에","meaning":"运动场，体育场","explanation":"운동장：运动场，体育场；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"운동장","audio":"/audio/899e5787d5587fd1d0c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26891","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날리러","meaning":"使飞扬，放飞","explanation":"날리다：使飞扬，放飞；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"날리다","audio":"/audio/e3a046ffc869c0e067dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16346","senseId":"1","lemma":"날리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"899e5787d5587fd1","term":"운동장","zh":"